  <History Date="26-12-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from XBlack Stormy 3000 RGBW Strobe (poor documentation.  no function ranges. channel 31 in 31 DMX mode is written as intensity. this makes no sense - left as macro for now.)" Version="5" />
